  "response_text": "Here’s a comprehensive list of the tasks I can assist you with, starting from the most recent (or most commonly used) ones:\n\n### **Email-Related Tasks**\n1. **Send emails** to one or multiple recipients, with optional attachments, CC, and BCC.\n2. **Delete emails** from your inbox by specifying the email ID.\n3. **Retrieve unread emails** and mark them as read.\n4. **Search for emails** by query (in subject or body) or filter by sender.\n5. **Retrieve sent, received, or draft emails**.\n6. **Search contacts** by name or email address.\n\n### **Calendar-Related Tasks**\n7. **Search calendar events** by query (in title or description) or filter by date.\n8. **Get all calendar events for a specific day**.\n9. **Create new calendar events** with details like title, start/end time, description, participants, and location.\n10. **Cancel calendar events** and notify participants.\n11. **Reschedule calendar events** and notify participants.\n12. **Add participants to existing calendar events** and notify them.\n\n### **Cloud Drive (File) Tasks**\n13. **Create files** in the cloud drive with specified content.\n14. **Delete files** by their file ID.\n15. **Search for files** by filename or content.\n16. **List all files** in the cloud drive.\n17. **Share files** with others, specifying permission levels (read or read-write).\n18. **Append content to files** by file ID.\n19. **Retrieve file content** by file ID.\n\n### **Miscellaneous**\n20. **Get the current date** to assist with scheduling or other time-sensitive tasks.\n\nLet me know which task you'd like help with!",
